    {
      "id": 22557640,
      "status": "Acknowledged",
      "summary": "Roadway Sign Maintenance",
      "description": "𝐍𝐨 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧𝐬 𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐯𝐞𝐝 𝐨𝐧 𝐅𝐫𝐞𝐝𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐤 𝐂𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐭𝐲 𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐭. Parking is allowed on only one side of 𝐑𝐢𝐯𝐞𝐫 𝐁𝐢𝐫𝐜𝐡 𝐑𝐨𝐚𝐝.  No Parking signs were originally post on the north side of the road, but some have been illegally removed.  If a sign was removed, stolen, or damaged, a driver lacks constructive notice of the restriction and cannot be ticketed. This has been a recurring issue on the road.  Residents park in the areas where No Parking signs have been removed and are never ticketed.",
