      "id": 22546661,
      "status": "Acknowledged",
      "summary": "Roadway General Request",
      "description": "Hello, I am writing this complaint in reference to the constant flow back and forth of dump truck traffic on Olive School Rd going to the sports complex in  Brunswick MD and soon to the new high school and the new housing development coming.  Our road has already been patched due to the heavy traffic.  This is a residential road and the constant noise is unbearable.  Starting around 6:30 am up to 5pm or after.  It feels as if I live in a construction zone honestly.  I also worry about the safety issue stemming from them.  My driveway is on a curve and the way these trucks fly back and forth is extremely unsafe.  I am requesting for Olive School RD to be made no weight over 5 ton I believe it is, to be allowed on this little road. There are other routes they can take.  464 is one option.  Thank you very much!!  ",
